      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Unable to reproduce this report. When toggled, \"Sexually suggestive\" content gating is switched to on and syncs to the VRChat Home website, and persists with VRChat client reboots. Toggling it off syncs to the VRChat Home website (again) and keeps it off after a restart.\n\nTested in both VRChat 2026.2.3p3 `Build 1867` and VRChat 2026.3.2p1 `Build 1902`, same outcomes.\n\nI'm verified 18+ and not in the UK where this content gating may or may not be enforced.",
