  "details": "- 1: Open big menu settings\n\n- 2: Enable the \"sexually suggestive\" content tag block\n\n- 3: Reboot VRChat session\n\n- 4: Check the content tag area, and you can see its disabled itself again.\n\nConsidering I know minors that have this also toggled off, I'd consider this an extremely important bug, since minors that have gone out of their way to disable Sexual content will also be having it auto re-enable without them knowing and thinking its on.",
